        "# Iterator\n",
        "\n",
        "An iterator produces values one at a time through `__next__()` and returns itself from `__iter__()`. It signals exhaustion with `StopIteration`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-iterator)"
      ]
    }
